cmu-open-vehicle-hood-blocked = Raise the windshield first.
cmu-open-vehicle-windshield-blocked = Close the hood first.
cmu-open-vehicle-engine-dead = The engine coughs and dies. It needs repairs under the hood.
cmu-open-vehicle-engine-examine = The engine is at {$percent}%.
cmu-open-vehicle-engine-fine = The engine doesn't need any work.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-fine = There's nothing to fix on the {$part}.
cmu-open-vehicle-wreck-warning = Flames burst from under {THE($vehicle)}'s hood! Get clear before it goes up!
cmu-open-vehicle-fire-out = The fire under {THE($vehicle)}'s hood dies down with a hiss.
cmu-open-vehicle-hull-wrecked = {CAPITALIZE(THE($vehicle))} buckles and sags on its wheels. It won't go any further until the hull is repaired.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-unscrewed = You take the screws out of the {$part}. Its bolts still hold it.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-unbolted = You unbolt the {$part}. It can be lifted off by hand.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-bolted = You bolt the {$part} on. Screw it down to finish.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-screwed = You screw the {$part} down.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-bolt-first = The {$part} is only hung on. Bolt it on with a wrench first.
cmu-open-vehicle-part-loaded = Take off what hangs on the {$part} first.
cmu-open-vehicle-kit-blocked = There's nothing to reach it on: the panel it hangs on is down or off.
cmu-open-vehicle-headlights-off = You switch the headlights off.
cmu-open-vehicle-headlights-low = You switch on the low beams.
cmu-open-vehicle-headlights-high = You switch on the high beams.
cmu-open-vehicle-headlights-broken = You flick the switch, but the headlights stay dark.
